# 7-segment counter fixture (MCS-4)
#
# Writes an incrementing nibble to the 4002 RAM output port of chip 0 via WMP.
# A 7-segment display attached to that port shows the accumulator cycling 0..F.
#
# FIM P0, 0x00 -> R0=0 so SRC selects RAM chip 0
# SRC P0       -> latch RAM chip 0 (selection persists across the loop)
# WMP          -> write ACC to the RAM output port of chip 0
# IAC          -> ACC = ACC + 1 (wraps 0x0..0xF)
# JUN 0x003    -> loop back to WMP
20 00       # FIM P0, 0x00
21          # SRC P0
E1          # WMP
F2          # IAC
40 03       # JUN 0x003
